        Case(
            "talk grpconf-india-2026:1298901",
            "Beyond Hello World: gRPC in Python for Real Systems\u000AgRPC tutorials make distributed systems look simple: define a .proto file, generate code, and call remote functions like local ones. That abstraction works - until production.\u000A\u000AThis talk explores four production challenges Python developers repeatedly encounter with gRPC. Through short live demonstrations where attendees predict the outcome before running the code, we'll uncover common misconceptions and build practical mental models.\u000A\u000ATopics include evolving Protocol Buffer schemas without breaking clients, handling streaming with flow control and backpressure, and building resilient services using deadlines, and interceptors for cross-cutting concerns like authentication and logging.\u000A\u000AAttendees will leave with a deeper understanding of how Python's gRPC ecosystem behaves in production and the confidence to design, debug, and evolve reliable gRPC services.",
            "101,3458,7592,2088,1024,24665,15042,1999,18750,2005,2613,3001,24665,15042,14924,26340,2191,5500,3001,2298,3722,1024,9375,1037,1012,15053,5371,1010,9699,3642,1010,1998,2655,6556,4972,2066,2334,3924,1012,2008,24504,2573,1011,2127,2537,1012,2023,2831,15102,2176,2537,7860,18750,9797,8385,8087,2007,24665,15042,1012,2083,2460,2444,13616,2073,19973,16014,1996,9560,2077,2770,1996,3642,1010,2057,1005,2222,26944,2691,28616,8663,24422,2015,1998,3857,6742,5177,4275,1012,7832,2421,20607,8778,17698,8040,28433,2015,2302,4911,7846,1010,8304,11058,2007,4834,2491,1998,2067,20110,5397,1010,1998,2311,24501,18622,4765,2578,2478,15117,2015,1010,1998,24727,2015,2005,2892,1011,6276,5936,2066,27280,1998,15899,1012,19973,2097,2681,2007,1037,6748,4824,1997,2129,18750,1005,1055,24665,15042,16927,16582,2015,1999,2537,1998,1996,7023,2000,2640,1010,2139,8569,2290,1010,1998,19852,10539,24665,15042,2578,1012,102",
            171,
