        Case(
            "talk kubecon-cloudnativecon-north-america-2026:1364856",
            "CLBO: ClashLoopBackOff: Attendee Edition\u000AGet ready for a fast-paced technical showdown where creativity, problem-solving, and Kubernetes skills take center stage!\u000A\u000AWatch two competitors go head-to-head with just 20 minutes to tackle a surprise challenge, from troubleshooting a broken cluster to deploying a service to production, without pre-built scripts or resources.\u000A\u000AFollow the action as the Scheduler (host) provides live commentary and engages with the audience. Competitors will be judged on Stability, Resiliency, Flexibility, and Observability. Come cheer on your favorite competitor and experience the excitement of live technical problem-solving!",
