        Case(
            "talk mcp-dev-summit-nairobi-2026:1322889",
            "MCP Handed Observability to OpenTelemetry. Now What?\u000AMCP's July 2026 spec quietly did two things to observability. It deprecated protocol-level logging in favor of OpenTelemetry, and it deleted the session ID with no deprecation window.\u000A\u000AThis session covers what MCP observability looks like now that the protocol has handed the job to OpenTelemetry. How the MCP semantic conventions shape a real trace from agent to client to server to the database behind it, why traceparent as a required header changes what a gateway can see without parsing request bodies, and how to rebuild correlation from the authenticated principal and explicit workflow IDs once the session is gone.\u000A\u000AWe'll trace a slow tool call end to end and find the actual bottleneck, then I'll finish on the parts that are still awkward like context propagation over stdio, and how much of a tool's input you can safely put in a span.",
            "101,11338,2361,4375,27885,8043,3567,8553,2000,2330,9834,21382,11129,1012,2085,2054,1029,11338,2361,1005,1055,2251,16798,2575,28699,5168,2106,2048,2477,2000,27885,8043,3567,8553,1012,2009,2139,28139,12921,8778,1011,2504,15899,1999,5684,1997,2330,9834,21382,11129,1010,1998,2009,17159,1996,5219,8909,2007,2053,2139,28139,10719,3332,1012,2023,5219,4472,2054,11338,2361,27885,8043,3567,8553,3504,2066,2085,2008,1996,8778,2038,4375,1996,3105,2000,2330,9834,21382,11129,1012,2129,1996,11338,2361,21641,12472,4338,1037,2613,7637,2013,4005,2000,7396,2000,8241,2000,1996,7809,2369,2009,1010,2339,7637,19362,4765,2004,1037,3223,20346,3431,2054,1037,11909,2064,2156,2302,11968,7741,5227,4230,1010,1998,2129,2000,14591,16902,2013,1996,14469,4383,4054,1998,13216,2147,12314,8909,2015,2320,1996,5219,2003,2908,1012,2057,1005,2222,7637,1037,4030,6994,2655,2203,2000,2203,1998,2424,1996,5025,5835,18278,1010,2059,1045,1005,2222,3926,2006,1996,3033,2008,2024,2145,9596,2066,6123,20594,2058,2358,20617,1010,1998,2129,2172,1997,1037,6994,1005,1055,7953,2017,2064,9689,2404,1999,1037,8487,1012,102",
            209,
