        Case(
            "talk pytorch-day-japan-2026:1318087",
            "Kernels Without Borders: Unifying the Kernel Ecosystem\u000AHigh-performance PyTorch applications increasingly depend on specialized kernels, but writing a fast kernel is only part of the problem. Projects also need to build across hardware and software configurations, distribute kernels, manage compatibility, version them safely, and integrate them into their own stacks.\u000A\u000AIn this talk, Sayak Paul and Aritra Roy Gosthipaty will introduce Hugging Face Kernels and show how the Kernel Hub provides a common layer for building, versioning, distributing, and consuming optimized kernels across the PyTorch ecosystem.\u000A\u000AWe will show how this abstraction lets projects share optimized implementations without maintaining their own packaging and distribution infrastructure, from declaring kernel dependencies to selecting compatible builds and locking versions for reproducible deployments.\u000A\u000AWe will also discuss how Kernel Hub is evolving beyond PyTorch, with support for interfaces such as TVM-FFI, and examine adoption in projects such as SGLang to show how shared kernel infrastructure can reduce integration overhead.",
            "101,16293,2015,2302,6645,1024,4895,11787,1996,16293,16927,2152,1011,2836,1052,22123,2953,2818,5097,6233,12530,2006,7772,16293,2015,1010,2021,3015,1037,3435,16293,2003,2069,2112,1997,1996,3291,1012,3934,2036,2342,2000,3857,2408,8051,1998,4007,22354,1010,16062,16293,2015,1010,6133,21778,1010,2544,2068,9689,1010,1998,17409,2068,2046,2037,2219,20829,1012,1999,2023,2831,1010,2360,4817,2703,1998,10488,6494,6060,2175,3367,5605,4017,2100,2097,8970,17662,2227,16293,2015,1998,2265,2129,1996,16293,9594,3640,1037,2691,6741,2005,2311,1010,2544,2075,1010,20083,1010,1998,15077,23569,27605,5422,16293,2015,2408,1996,1052,22123,2953,2818,16927,1012,2057,2097,2265,2129,2023,24504,11082,3934,3745,23569,27605,5422,24977,2302,8498,2037,2219,14793,1998,4353,6502,1010,2013,13752,16293,12530,15266,2000,17739,11892,16473,1998,14889,4617,2005,16360,14127,21104,10813,2015,1012,2057,2097,2036,6848,2129,16293,9594,2003,20607,3458,1052,22123,2953,2818,1010,2007,2490,2005,19706,2107,2004,2694,2213,1011,21461,2072,1010,1998,11628,9886,1999,3934,2107,2004,22214,25023,2000,2265,2129,4207,16293,6502,2064,5547,8346,8964,1012,102",
            212,
