        Case(
            "talk pytorch-day-japan-2026:1342758",
            "Adapting vLLM and SGLang to Diverse AI Accelerators with FlagOS\u000AAdapting inference frameworks to different AI accelerators requires coordinated work across operators, compilers, runtimes, and communication. This talk uses vLLM and SGLang to show how FlagOS organizes that adaptation while preserving familiar serving interfaces.\u000A\u000AWe connect engine plugins to FlagGems operators and explain the roles of FlagTree's supported compiler paths and optional FlagCX communication. A concrete RMSNorm example shows how two engine interfaces reach shared computation while retaining framework-specific handling. Device-independent installation and vendor fallback illustrate additional hardware integration requirements.\u000A\u000AWe then examine validation across eager and graph modes, text and image requests, and cold-start behavior, using public vLLM plugin tests and documented SGLang deployment cases.\u000A\u000AAttendees will learn how to structure multi-accelerator adaptation, decide what can be reused across frameworks and chips, and verify correctness and performance. The session is grounded in open-source code, upstream changes, and deployment evidence.",
            "101,25357,1058,3363,2213,1998,22214,25023,2000,7578,9932,23468,2015,2007,5210,2891,25357,28937,7705,2015,2000,2367,9932,23468,2015,5942,14206,2147,2408,9224,1010,21624,2015,1010,2448,7292,2015,1010,1998,4807,1012,2023,2831,3594,1058,3363,2213,1998,22214,25023,2000,2265,2129,5210,2891,22013,2008,6789,2096,15224,5220,3529,19706,1012,2057,7532,3194,13354,7076,2000,5210,3351,5244,9224,1998,4863,1996,4395,1997,5210,13334,1005,1055,3569,21624,10425,1998,11887,5210,2278,2595,4807,1012,1037,5509,29311,12131,2213,2742,3065,2129,2048,3194,19706,3362,4207,22334,2096,12823,7705,1011,3563,8304,1012,5080,1011,2981,8272,1998,21431,2991,5963,19141,3176,8051,8346,5918,1012,2057,2059,11628,27354,2408,9461,1998,10629,11583,1010,3793,1998,3746,11186,1010,1998,3147,1011,2707,5248,1010,2478,2270,1058,3363,2213,13354,2378,5852,1998,8832,22214,25023,10813,3572,1012,19973,2097,4553,2129,2000,3252,4800,1011,23468,6789,1010,5630,2054,2064,2022,26513,2408,7705,2015,1998,11772,1010,1998,20410,6149,2791,1998,2836,1012,1996,5219,2003,16764,1999,2330,1011,3120,3642,1010,13909,3431,1010,1998,10813,3350,1012,102",
