        Case(
            "talk pytorch-day-japan-2026:1343025",
            "Beyond GPUs: A Practical Playbook for Bringing ExecuTorch to a New Edge Accelerator\u000AEdge and on-prem AI inference increasingly runs on silicon that isn't a GPU. This talk tells the story of bringing ExecuTorch \u2014 PyTorch's on-device inference runtime \u2014 to IBM's AIU, a purpose-built accelerator for enterprise inference, entirely through ExecuTorch's public backend-delegate extension points: a custom partitioner, an AOT-only compilation path with well-defined CPU-fallback boundaries, a mixed-dtype tensor bridge, and static bucketing for dynamic shapes.\u000A\u000AWe'll walk through the concrete design decisions and dead ends behind a working, device-verified delegate running real language models (Granite) end-to-end on the AIU, then generalize them into a practical checklist for anyone extending ExecuTorch to a new, independent accelerator. Attendees will leave with a concrete map of ExecuTorch's backend extension surface \u2014 what's genuinely reusable, what's hardware-specific, and where the sharp edges are \u2014 whether their target is a novel edge chip, an emerging vendor's silicon, or an in-house accelerator.",
            "101,3458,14246,2271,1024,1037,6742,2377,8654,2005,5026,4654,8586,16161,11140,2000,1037,2047,3341,23468,3341,1998,2006,1011,26563,9932,28937,6233,3216,2006,13773,2008,3475,1005,1056,1037,14246,2226,1012,2023,2831,4136,1996,2466,1997,5026,4654,8586,16161,11140,1517,1052,22123,2953,2818,1005,1055,2006,1011,5080,28937,2448,7292,1517,2000,9980,1005,1055,9932,2226,1010,1037,3800,1011,2328,23468,2005,6960,28937,1010,4498,2083,4654,8586,16161,11140,1005,1055,2270,2067,10497,1011,11849,5331,2685,1024,1037,7661,13571,2121,1010,2019,20118,2102,1011,2069,6268,4130,2007,2092,1011,4225,17368,1011,2991,5963,7372,1010,1037,3816,1011,26718,18863,23435,2958,1010,1998,10763,13610,2075,2005,8790,10466,1012,2057,1005,2222,3328,2083,1996,5509,2640,6567,1998,2757,4515,2369,1037,2551,1010,5080,1011,20119,11849,2770,2613,2653,4275,1006,9753,1007,2203,1011,2000,1011,2203,2006,1996,9932,2226,1010,2059,2236,4697,2068,2046,1037,6742,4638,9863,2005,3087,8402,4654,8586,16161,11140,2000,1037,2047,1010,2981,23468,1012,19973,2097,2681,2007,1037,5509,4949,1997,4654,8586,16161,11140,1005,1055,2067,10497,5331,3302,1517,2054,1005,1055,15958,2128,10383,3468,1010,2054,1005,1055,8051,1011,3563,1010,1998,2073,1996,4629,7926,2024,1517,3251,2037,4539,2003,1037,3117,3341,9090,1010,2019,8361,21431,1005,1055,13773,1010,2030,2019,1999,1011,2160,23468,1012,102",
